TI  - Elective induction for pregnancies at or beyond 41 weeks of gestation and its impact on stillbirths: a systematic review with meta-analysis
AU  - Arwa Abbas Hussain
AU  - Mohammad Yawar Yakoob
AU  - Aamer Imdad
AU  - Zulfiqar A Bhutta
JO  - BMC Public Health
PY  - 2011
VL  - 11
IS  - S3
